{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46654","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭菊 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见庭菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见庭菊，几劳栽种工。\n可能经卧疾，相倚自成丛。\n翠萼低含露，金英尽亚风。\n那知予爱尔，不在酒杯中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}